<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>美联储面临的巨大压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed</link><description>以及他们必须回答的难题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed'&gt;美联储面临的巨大压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Big Pressures Facing the Fed&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/the-big-pressures-facing-the-fed</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:53:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能工具重塑黑色星期五体验</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video</link><description>随着假日购物季的到来，零售额预计将首次突破 1 万亿美元，购物者表示他们今年的支出将比去年更多。他们还有望让人工智能对他们购买的商品有更多的发言权。高力国际 (Colliers) 美国全国零售总监 Anjee Solanki 解释了第一个真正的“智能人工智能”假日季对购物者意味着什么。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video'&gt;人工智能工具重塑黑色星期五体验&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Tools Reshape the Black Friday Experience&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/ai-tools-reshape-the-black-friday-experience-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:54:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rebound as Traders Pile Into Battered Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Anterix 可能是 SpaceX 的下一个移动网络接入交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anterix-could-be-spacex-s-next-deal-for-mobile-network-access</link><description>在 SpaceX 向着成熟的移动服务提供商迈进的过程中，它对无线频谱的不懈追求中，它的目标可能是一个母矿：Anterix Inc.。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anterix-could-be-spacex-s-next-deal-for-mobile-network-access'&gt;Anterix 可能是 SpaceX 的下一个移动网络接入交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anterix Could Be SpaceX’s Next Deal for Mobile Network Access&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anterix-could-be-spacex-s-next-deal-for-mobile-network-access</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:58:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise at End of Wild Week in AI-Trade Bounce: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>